<view class="map-page">
  <map
    id="catMap"
    class="map"
    latitude="{{center.lat}}"
    longitude="{{center.lng}}"
    scale="{{scale}}"
    markers="{{markers}}"
    show-location
    enable-poi
    bindmarkertap="onMarkerTap"
  ></map>

  <view class="map-top">
    <view class="map-hint" wx:if="{{!cats.length && !loading}}">
      还没有标注猫点位，社团成员可在猫档案里填写常驻位置
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="locate-btn" bindtap="locateMe">◎</view>
  <view class="legend-btn" bindtap="toggleLegend">ℹ️</view>

  <!-- 点位说明（对齐预览：图例 + 坐标模糊化说明） -->
  <view class="legend-card" wx:if="{{showLegend}}" bindtap="toggleLegend">
    <view class="lg-title bold">点位说明</view>
    <view class="lg-line">
      <text class="tag ok">已绝育</text>
      <text class="small muted">健康可控</text>
      <text class="tag warn" style="margin-left:24rpx">未绝育</text>
      <text class="small muted">待关注 / 待抓捕</text>
    </view>
    <view class="lg-note small muted">
      幼猫与病猫的精确坐标对非社团成员做模糊化处理 —— 吸取街猫直播被虐猫者利用的教训，避免聚集点被别有用心的人定位。
    </view>
    <view class="lg-close small muted">点击任意处关闭</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 底部猫点位列表 -->
  <view class="bottom-sheet {{showList ? '' : 'collapsed'}}">
    <view class="sheet-handle" bindtap="toggleList">
      <text class="handle-title">附近猫咪 {{cats.length}}</text>
      <text class="handle-arrow">{{showList ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view scroll-y class="sheet-list" wx:if="{{showList}}">
      <view
        class="sheet-item {{activeId === item._id ? 'on' : ''}}"
        wx:for="{{cats}}"
        wx:key="_id"
        data-id="{{item._id}}"
        bindtap="goDetail"
      >
        <view class="sheet-avatar">
          <image wx:if="{{item.avatar}}" src="{{item.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" />
          <text wx:else>🐱</text>
        </view>
        <view class="sheet-info">
          <view class="flex">
            <text class="bold">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="tag {{item.sterilized === 'yes' ? 'ok' : 'warn'}}">
              {{item.sterilized === 'yes' ? '已绝育' : '未绝育'}}
            </text>
          </view>
          <view class="small muted">{{item.spot || '校园内'}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="fab-small" bindtap="goSighting">打卡</view>
</view>
